  unitName: Machine Lord Heins
  unitId: 30414
  unitNumber: 1287
  description: Appointment to the Ishgria Expeditionary Force was a dream come true
    for Heins, who longed to complete work on his automaton, Zenas. Even an official
    pardon for his crimes meant nothing to Heins, and the moment he was released
    from prison, he began new modifications on Zenas. Claiming it was necessary for
    the expeditionary mission, Heins gathered the latest information on otherworldly
    technology, and fashioned armor plates designed specifically for combat against
    the demons. The captain's records show that Heins could not be coaxed from his
    workshop until the moment of departure.
  summonDesc: This place is the ideal environment to test Zenas's abilities. What
    more could I ever wish for?
  fusionDesc: So, you can also see Zenas's potential to become the ultimate weapon.
    Let my demonstration begin!
  evoDesc: Yes...yes!! Zenas's performance will greatly benefit from this improvement.
    Now, what to work on next...
  element: 3
  rarity: 4
